# Environment variable convention (#40)
#
# No environment variables are required yet. This file exists to establish the
# convention ahead of the epics that need one:
#   - Epic #3 (Anthropic / AI SDK key for Claude Haiku 4.5)
#   - Epic #5 (Upstash rate limiting)
#   - Epic #6 (Neon Postgres / pgvector)
#
# Real values are never committed. They live in:
#   - Local development: an untracked `.env.local` in `apps/web/` (git-ignored, see .gitignore).
#   - Preview and Production: Vercel project settings (Project -> Settings -> Environment
#     Variables), scoped per environment (Development / Preview / Production).
#
# When a new variable is introduced, add a commented placeholder line for it here
# (NAME=), e.g.:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
